    class="stat-sep"
  >
    |
  </span>
  <span
    class="statusbar-metrics stat"
    title="当前会话花费约 ￥0.0234（API token × 中文官网人民币单价）"
  >
    <span
      class="stat-label"
    >
      本会话
    </span>
    <span
      class="stat-value"
    >
      ￥0.0234
    </span>
  </span>
  <span
    class="stat-sep"
  >
    |
  </span>
  <span
    aria-expanded="false"
    aria-label="上下文占用归因"
    class="statusbar-context stat statusbar-context--clickable"
    role="button"
    tabindex="0"
    title="上下文占用约 4%（prompt 40,000 / 有效窗口 128,000）；重复内容约 27%"
  >
    <span
      class="stat-label"
    >
